1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:07,369
That tendency is measured by entropy, S, a measure of the randomness or disorder of a system.

2
00:00:07,369 --> 00:00:08,763
It is a state function.

3
00:00:08,763 --> 00:00:16,445
For a change carried out reversibly at temperature T, delta S is the heat absorbed reversibly, divided by T.

